 a whole video  just listing all the missing parents in  the world of Disney these are just a few  of them there are actually over 30  Disney movies with missing parents well  one of the reasons has to do with Walt  Disney's very own mother your tissues  ready because this is one seriously sad  story so Walt Disney was pretty young  when he became successful he was  animating when he was in his 20s by the  late 1930s he was making lots of  cartoons with his company in 1937 he  released Snow White which was the first  feature-length Disney movie Walt's loved  his family he really adored his parents  and since he had become really  successful he decided to do something  nice for them so he bought them a house  but it turned bad really quickly see  houses used to be heated with gas before  electric heating well some houses still  are but they are a lot safer these days  the house that Disney bought for his mom  and dad had a gas leak when gas leaks it  releases carbon monoxide this invisible  gas has no smell and it is super  poisonous it can make you really sick or  even cause people to pass away these  days houses have carbon monoxide  monitors to tell you if there's a leak  but this was a long time ago the date it  happened isn't super clear some sources  say it was 1938 the year after Snow  White was released others say it was in  the early 1940s  either way this gas leak caused a major  tragedy Disney sent some workers from a  studio out to his parents new house they  tried to fix the gas leak and they  thought they did but they weren't really  experts in the matter so the gas  continued to leak Walt Disney's father  ended up hospitalized from the carbon  monoxide poisoning but his mother wasn't  so lucky  this was a really awful time in Walt's  life he definitely blamed himself  because he bought the house of course we  know it wasn't his fault but he didn't  see it that way he lived with guilt  about it for the rest of his life and he  really didn't talk about what happened  much that's never a good idea it's  important to talk about how you feel  with people who genuinely care for you  poor Walt's we feel so bad for him as a  result of this tragedy he included lost  parents in a lot of his movies this  isn't the only reason why there are so  many missing Disney parents though it's  actually a lot more complicated than  that  and of course Snow White was released  before Walt's mother died depending on  the actual year it happened there might  have been a few more movies with tragic  parents stories like Dumbo so we can't  blame all of it on Disney's own tragic  backstory also Walt Disney passed away  in the 1960s but Disney the company has  been making movies without parents for  decades since then are they doing it  because of Ault Disney's mom that just  doesn't seem realistic another reason  was given by Don han who produced  Maleficent he says that Disney movies  are often coming-of-age stories the  characters need some  to happen that will make them grow up  since Disney movies are usually only  about 90 minutes long they need an easy  way to do this  something major needs to happen either  on screen or off screen to make our main  characters grow up quickly  Disney seems to think the easiest way to  do this is by making them grow up alone  and misguided sure that would make any  character grow up really fast but there  has to be some other way to do it some  people have said that missing parents  are also important to the stories most  Disney characters have some sort of  adventure they also make mistakes that  give us awesome plots a lot of people  pointed out that parents especially moms  keep us from making big mistakes like  that Anne's parents tend to keep us from  going off on big dangerous adventures  but we aren't sure we buy that look at  Mulan having two parents didn't keep her  from running away and saving all of  China just like Mulan Moana leaves her  two parents behind to save her people  and she is on